      }
     ],
     "value": "Plays an important role in the formation of lipid droplets during the differentiation and maturation of adipocytes (PubMed:31708432). Together with seipin (BSCL2), defines the sites of lipid droplet formation in the endoplasmic reticulum and promotes the aggregation of triacylglycerol molecules to form the core of a lipid droplet (nucleation) in the endoplasmic reticulum and drive budding of lipid droplets into the cytoplasm (PubMed:31708432)"
    }
